  <section><para dir="ltr">The scatter plot shows data on weight in pounds (x) and fuel efficiency in miles per gallon (y) for 13 cars. </para>
<para dir="ltr"><emphasis><figure><media alt="points (2500, 28), (3259,23), (3500,25), (3559,22), (3550,18), (3700,20), (4000,20), (4000,18), (4400,16), (4500,16), (4750, 14), (5250, 12), (5700,15)"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/5256cb607d1ba353024ca8ac5fab4e3a59a4a524"/></media></figure></emphasis></para>
<para dir="ltr"><span><span>Which statement best describes the data?</span></span></para></section>
